  "abstract": "This is the first step in a new analytical research program to understand the mechanics of the Fourier Forecaster SOTA. This experiment re-runs the SOTA model (ID 335) with one modification: a complete() function is added to save the final trained parameters of one of the random seeds to lineage storage. This will enable subsequent analytical runs to load the trained model for detailed inspection.",
